## Common pitfalls

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
|---------|-------|-----|
| `local_file` camera creation fails | Placeholder image files don't exist at the specified path | Complete Prerequisites step 2 first |
| AppDaemon "entity not found" on startup | Camera entities not created before AppDaemon start | Complete Prerequisites step 3, then restart AppDaemon |
| Images don't update after run selection | `ds_refresh_detection_summary_viewer_www` shell command missing from `configuration.yaml` | Add it per README, restart HA |
| `binary_sensor` door never triggers notify | Missing `door_open_state: "on"` in config; using default `"open"` which never matches `on`/`off` | Set `door_open_state: "on"` and `door_closed_state: "off"` for contact sensors |
| Notification URL doesn't navigate to correct view | `notification_url` not set in `door_notify` config | Add `notification_url: "/detection-summary/{bundle_key}"` |
| Run picker not populating | Viewer app not running, or `detection_summary/run_published` event not fired | Check AppDaemon logs; ensure both `detection_summary_{bundle_key}` and `detection_viewer_{bundle_key}` instances are running |
| `camera.{bundle_key}_detection_summary_selected_*` not updating | `hass_entities` block missing from viewer config | Add `selected_best_image_camera_entity_id` and `selected_generated_image_camera_entity_id` to `hass_entities` |
| Dashboard view empty after MCP update | `config_hash` truncated or stale | Re-read [ha-dashboard-playbook.mdc](.cursor/playbooks/ha-dashboard-playbook.mdc). Use the **full** `config_hash` string (all 16 hex chars). If stale, re-fetch with `ha_config_get_dashboard`. |
